ng for in a candidate. It's a good idea to", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}, {"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "utilize", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 4, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "incorrect", "contents": [{"content": "utility", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "post_question", "contents": {"content": "your network. Find jobs that match your skill set. ", "type": ""}}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 9, "template_override": 2}, {"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 10, "template_override": 1}, {"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Follow the job search process. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn9le03ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "_data": [], "title": "", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<p>It's time for me to start looking for a new job. I've decided that I'm going to post about my journey on this blog.</p>Searching for a job is a process, and sometimes can be a lengthy one. I know I can be successful in the job search, but it will take a reasonable investment of time and energy.", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"text": "<p>First, I will need to identify and analyze my skills and interests. I'm going to think about what I want to do and how well my skills and interests align with the expectations of the job. I'm going to see what jobs are out there. I'll have to determine if I need to gain any additional skill sets or experiences to help me in the job search process.</p>I'm going to create a master resume. That way, I can change it for each specific job. I'll have to work on writing cover letters as well.  Today, I'm reviewing my social media accounts to make sure the image I present online is representative of how you want to be seen by prospective employers.", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img06.jpg", "time": "19000", "id": 2}, {"text": "<p>I'm debating on whether or not I'll \ufeffutilize my network. Many employers and job seekers affirm that this is the most powerful tool you can use to find a job. I read that many times positions are filled by candidates known by the employer through their contacts.</p>Finally, I'll start researching the kinds of jobs that are out there that match my interests and skill set. I'm going to start by looking within Boston. I want to stay in the city. I'm thinking about attending a job fair. I wonder if there are any coming up.", "image": "engenn9le03ob02re2img07.jpg", "time": "64000", "id": 3}], "coverimg": "engenn9le03ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob02re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The World of Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Process to Get a Job", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Future with \u201cWill\u201d", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " One of the most common ways of talking about the<span class=\"strong\"> future </span>in English is by using the auxiliary verb \u201c<span class=\"italic\">will</span>\u201d. Here's more on how to form and talk about the future with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">will</span>\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about decisions made at the time of speaking.<br><span class=\"italic\">I will make use of my network.</span><br></li><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to talk about facts or events in the future.  <br><span class=\"italic\">I will start researching jobs.</span> <br></li><li>You use \u201cwill\u201d to make predictions based on personal opinions. <br><span class=\"italic\"> It will take a reasonable investment of time and energy.</span></ul><br><br>Here's how to form the future with \u201cwill\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Affirmative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + will/'ll\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Negative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"subject + will not /won't\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Interrogative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Will + subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go through all the steps?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "They'll walk us through all the steps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We won't go through all the steps.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Will you go through all the steps with me?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking about the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Using \u201cwill\u201d is one way to talk about the future. There are two other ways you can talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about intentions, you use<span class=\"italic\"> be going to.</span><br>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Present Continuous</span> tense.<br>Many people use<span class=\"italic\"> be going to</span> in place of the</span class=\"strong\"> Present Continuous </span>tense. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk about things that are not decided; make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future; make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will </span>look for a new job.</span><br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think it <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will </span>take a lot of time and energy.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Be going to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'm going to </span>start a blog about my journey.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">I'm reviewing </span>my account this afternoon.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job search ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the act of looking for employment  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I know I can be successful in the job search.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about getting a job.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "investment ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that you do because it will be useful later ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:It will take a reasonable investment of time and energy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "skills and interests ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " things you do well and enjoy doing because you have learned and practised them ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will need to identify and analyze my skills and interests.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "master resume", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a document which includes your education and your previous jobs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I'm going to create a master resume.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cover letter ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a letter that you send with documents that give information about its contents ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have to work on writing cover letters as well. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "representative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes, portray yourself in a particular way  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure the image you present online is representative of how you want to be seen by prospective employees.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to utilize ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to use something for a particular purpose  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can \ufeffutilize social media to find a job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "network ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of people that are connected", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "  Example:  I can also \ufeffutilize my network to find a job. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "job fair ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event where people go to get information about different kinds of jobs ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm thinking about attending a job fair.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write down all the steps of the job search process. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After you have done that, write down your plans on how you will carry out each step of the process. Write down the things you have completed and things you will need to do to complete that step.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read through your plan. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share and compare your plan with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about the job search process.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my future plans related to the job search.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about the job search process and my future plans with my partner.", "type": "text"}]}]}